---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const pageTitle = "About myself";
---

<Layout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <section class="hero-section about-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h2 class="hero-greeting">Hi, I'm Ellie 🌸</h2>
      <p>Hi there — I’m <strong>Luisa (Ellie) Escobar-Robledo</strong>, a physician-turned-computational biologist fascinated by how living systems think, adapt, and communicate through rhythm and signal.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="marker-grid about-grid">
    <article class="about-card about-card--blue">
      <header class="about-card__header">
        <h3>Where I'm From</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="about-card__body">
        <p>I was born and raised in Medellín, Colombia, where I studied medicine before moving into the world of data science and, eventually, computational biology. I’m now a PhD student in the <strong>Joint Carnegie Mellon – University of Pittsburgh Program</strong>, where I work under <strong>Dr. Keisuke Ishihara</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="about-card about-card--pink">
      <header class="about-card__header">
        <h3>What I Build</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="about-card__body">
        <p>My work lives at the intersection of biology, optics, and engineering. I create <strong>high-throughput platforms to record cardiac electrical activity</strong> from organoids using a device I’ve nicknamed <em>Vicky</em>, probing how tissues capture the rhythm of a heartbeat.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="about-card about-card--lilac">
      <header class="about-card__header">
        <h3>Before Pittsburgh</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="about-card__body">
        <p>I’ve been a <strong>data scientist at Rappi</strong>, modeling delivery times, and a <strong>researcher in Barcelona</strong> studying electrocardiograms with Dr. Antoni Bayés de Luna’s group. Along the way, I fell in love with the space where cardiology meets computation.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="about-card about-card--blue">
      <header class="about-card__header">
        <h3>Beyond the Bench</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="about-card__body">
        <p>Outside the lab, you’ll find me writing, tinkering with things that glow, or geeking out about science like it’s storytelling. I’m also an anime fan, guitar learner, and unwavering coffee devotee (Colombian, always ☕️).</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="about-card about-card--pink">
      <header class="about-card__header">
        <h3>Why This Site Exists</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="about-card__body">
        <p>This corner of the internet is where I archive my research, catalog the reflections that keep me grounded, and share the small discoveries that keep my heart (and code) alive.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
